menu "RBPower Configuration"

    config RBPOWER_VERBOSE_DEBUG
        bool "Enable RBPower Verbose Debug Logging"
        default n
        help
            Enable extremely detailed verbose debug logging for RBPower modules:
            - Flash operations: detailed buffer state, sector transitions
            - Runtime config: slot allocation, metadata operations
            - Statistics: record-level tracking and cache operations

            WARNING: This produces MASSIVE log output and should ONLY be
            enabled when debugging specific Flash or statistics issues.
            This will significantly impact performance.

endmenu # RBPower Configuration
